yed report and opens in\n  standard spreadsheet tooling.\n- The report offers no automated reclamation or deletion action, consistent\n  with the strategy's out-of-scope list.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P1): fully covered — per-project idle-workbench report (last\n  activity, owner, reserved resources) sourced from the notebook controller's\n  activity tracking.\n- HLR-3 (P2, bundled): CSV export of this report is bundled into this epic\n  rather than split out — the export renders the same report data on the same\n  report view this epic builds, so splitting it would double-touch the same\n  UI surface and data structure.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":42302,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87724731a85baab2","agent_id":"af14097cc984e8da3","session_id":"accbcd91-65ae-42f1-87a7-23c32a932432","uuid":"30aad80e-7030-4194-a6ef-51151b04b7d1","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:52:23.122Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
