{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac4527bef9698731","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9016-E003\n3\ttitle: Stale pipeline-run report in the web console\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9016\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 8\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Stale pipeline-run report in the web console\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tAdds a stale pipeline-run report to the RHOAI web console. The report lists\n34\tcompleted pipeline runs older than a configurable age, together with their\n35\tretained artifacts, sourced from Kubeflow Pipelines run metadata, so\n36\tadministrators can see where storage is accumulating. Includes CSV export of\n37\tthe report for administrators.\n38\t\n39\t## Scope\n40\t\n41\t- New report view in the console, scoped per project, listing completed\n42\t  pipeline runs older than a configurable age threshold, with each run's\n43\t  age/completion information and its retained artifacts.\n44\t- Data is sourced from Kubeflow Pipelines run metadata via the KFP v2 REST\n45\t  API, the documented interface the console already uses to surface pipeline\n46\t  runs.\n47\t- The staleness age threshold is configurable; where the threshold is\n48\t  configured (per-project administrator setting vs. deployment-level\n49\t  default) is an implementation decision for the Dashboard team.\n50\t- CSV export of the report: administrators can download the report contents\n51\t  as a CSV file.\n52\t- The report is read-only — no deletion or reclamation action is offered\n53\t  (automated reclamation is out of scope for the strategy).\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Given a project with completed pipeline runs of varying ages, the console\n58\t  shows a stale pipeline-run report listing the completed runs older than the\n59\t  configured age, including their retained artifacts.\n60\t- The staleness age threshold is configurable, and changing it changes which\n61\t  runs appear in the report.\n62\t- Report contents reconcile with Kubeflow Pipelines run metadata (completion\n63\t  state and timestamps, artifact references) — this validates the pipelines\n64\t  component as a correct, working data source.\n65\t- Given the report, an administrator can export it as CSV; the exported file\n66\t  contains the same rows and columns as the displayed report and opens in\n67\t  standard spreadsheet tooling.\n68\t- The report offers no automated reclamation or deletion action, consistent\n69\t  with the strategy's out-of-scope list.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-2 (P1): fully covered — stale pipeline-run report (completed runs\n74\t  older than a configurable age with retained artifacts) sourced from\n75\t  Kubeflow Pipelines run metadata.\n76\t- HLR-3 (P2, bundled): CSV export of this report is bundled into this epic\n77\t  rather than split out — the export renders the same report data on the same\n78\t  report view this epic builds, so splitting it would double-touch the same\n79\t  UI surface and data structure.\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b96e559e4074efe0","agent_id":"abc16d25dd159bf8f","session_id":"accbcd91-65ae-42f1-87a7-23c32a932432","uuid":"58fdb68d-8d6a-4b63-8947-0f31c4e5a446","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:54:17.849Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac4527bef9698731","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9016 decomposition"}
